:''This article is about the enemy. For the Cat Unit, see [[Guile (Uber Rare Cat)]].''

'''Guile''' is an enemy unit that appears in the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. He was added in [[Version 8.10 Update#Update 8.10.5|Version 8.10.5]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Guile
|image = E 482.png
|first appearance = [[Impregnable Fortress (Easy)]]
|money drop = 1,000¢ - 3,950¢
}}

==Enemy==
Very high health, average damage and range as well as a guaranteed chance to [[Slow]] the players [[Cat Units]]. This fighter isn't much of a threat due to all stages he appears in have him at a low magnification or 100%, excluding [[The Clawed Rondo (Hard)|The Clawed Rondo]] which has him at 110% and [[Arena of Honor/I Seek the Strongest (Old)|I Seek the Strongest]] of which his highest is at 200% magnification.

==Strategy==
As usual bring units that can outrange him, since his range is only at 420 there is a large variety of [[Cat Units]] to use. The same goes for units that are [[:Category:Cats with Slow Immunity|Immune to Slow]] and are [[:Category:Anti-Traitless Cats|Anti-Traitless]].<br>
For the Street Fighter stages he appears at low to 100% magnifications all-round making him no big threat.<br>
In his [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event#New Challenger|New Challenger]] stages the Easy stage is no big deal and the same can be said for the Expert stage.<br>
However for the [[Ranking Dojo]] stage, he will appear at low magnifications and later on high magnifications capping at 200% which may not even appear if the player takes too long.

